lass=\"video-wrap\">\n<div class=\"video-label\">✦ See <span>Scrisorile cu Flori<\/span> experience ✦<\/div>\n<div class=\"video-container\">\n<iframe allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture\" allowfullscreen=\"\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/www.youtube.com\/embed\/6ha7O6mSzkE?rel=0&amp;modestbranding=1\" title=\"The Flower Letters — Gift Experience\">\n<\/iframe>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- Review carousel -->\n<div class=\"reviews-wrap\">\n<div class=\"reviews-heading\"><span>★★★★★<\/span>  What gifters are saying<\/div>\n<div class=\"carousel-track-wrap\">\n<div class=\"carousel-track\" id=\"reviewTrack\">\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">Got the Flower Letters for my Mom for Mother's Day. She loved them so much that my husband and I read them too! Ordered our second set for this Mother's Day. Well worth the money!<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Lynn H., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">I purchased this for my mother who is 88 and loves to read. She loves it and looks forward to the letters coming. Best Christmas gift I ever gave her.<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Jan S., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">Best gift EVER! Sent to three families who are thoroughly enjoying every mailing. Don't hesitate to gift for Mother's Day!<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Mary Helen H., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">I purchased this as a gift. After talking with the recipient they informed me that she loves it — and that the envelope is so pretty she hates to open it. I would recommend this if you're searching for something unique and different.<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Marguarita M., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">I purchased when I noticed a friend call me in tears — super happy tears — when the first letter arrived. It was the perfect surprise, and will continue to bring her joy for an entire year.<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Katherine Y., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">We bought this for our 84 yr old Mom and she absolutely adores everything about this! It's nostalgia, beauty, and a story — worth the wait every few weeks. I'd give it a thousand stars if I could!<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Cynthia, verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">I bought this for my mom for Mothers Day. She loves it and looks forward to receiving her letters! She keeps the tin with all of the letters on her side table and has read them several times! The gift that keeps on giving!<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Stacie B., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-slide\">\n<div class=\"review-card\">\n<div class=\"review-quote\">This is the second year that I've gifted my mother Flower Letters for Christmas. She loves walking to the mailbox to find beautiful envelopes. I highly recommend Flower Letters as a gift for someone you want to know you're thinking of them all year long!<\/div>\n<div class=\"review-meta\"><span class=\"review-author\">— Tanya Y., verified buyer<\/span><span class=\"review-stars\">★★★★★<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"carousel-dots\" id=\"reviewDots\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<!-- Section header -->\n<div class=\"section-header\">\n<h2>Explore Print &amp; Email Gift Cards<\/h2>\n<div class=\"divider\"><\/div>\n<p class=\"section-para\">Every story includes a beautifully designed gift introduction card — printable or digital — so gifting is simple, convenient, and ready the moment you need it.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<!-- Story cards -->\n<table id=\"storiesGrid\" style=\"width:100%;max-width:900px;margin:0 auto;border-collapse:separate;border-spacing:12px;display:table!important;table-layout:fixed!important;\"><tbody>\n<tr style=\"display:table-row!important;vertical-align:top!important;\">\n<td style=\"display:table-cell!important;width:50%!important;vertical-align:top!important;padding:0!important;\">\n<div class=\"story-card theme-camellia\">\n<img alt=\"The Camellia Grace Letters\" class=\"card-image\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https:\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0419\/4517\/0084\/files\/Story_Photos_wLogo_2_812ad21e-4603-4661-bbb6-2a39dd96df81.jpg?v=1774905838\">\n<input class=\"card-toggle\" id=\"toggle-camellia\" type=\"checkbox\">\n<label class=\"card-header\" for=\"toggle-camellia\">\n<div class=\"card-header-text\">\n<div class=\"card-tag\">Epoca de Aur<\/div>\n<div class=\"card-title\">The Camellia Grace Letters<\/div>\n<div class=\"card-subtitle\">Society, secrets &amp; elegance<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div class=\"card-chevron\">▾<\/div>\n<\/label>\n<div class=\"card-body\">\n<p class=\"card-desc\">Step into the glamour of the Gilded Age with Camellia — a world of ballrooms, ambition, and letters sealed with longing.<\/p>\n<div class=\"card-links\">\n<a class=\"btn btn-shop\